Aegis Wing XBLA Recomp
======================

Scope
-----

This licence covers only the original code written for this PC recompilation
project: for example src/, tools/ (except Extract-STFS.ps1), packaging/,
cmake/, the build files, and this project's own changes to ReXGlue in
patches/rexglue.patch.

It does NOT cover, and grants no rights in:

  - Aegis Wing, its game program (default.xex), game data and assets, and
    the Aegis Wing, Xbox and Xbox 360 names and marks, which belong to
    Microsoft and their other respective rights holders. None of these are
    included in this repository; players supply their own copy of the game.
  - Code that tools/Regenerate-Code.ps1 produces in generated/default from a
    player's own default.xex (a translation of the original game program).
    It is not part of this repository.
  - ReXGlue (the rexglue-sdk submodule) and the ReXGlue code that
    patches/rexglue.patch modifies, which remain under ReXGlue's own
    BSD-3-Clause licence (rexglue-sdk/LICENSE).
  - Third-party libraries used by ReXGlue, which remain under their own
    licences (see packaging/licenses/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt).
  - tools/Extract-STFS.ps1, which is derived from Velocity and licensed under
    the GNU General Public License version 3
    (packaging/licenses/LICENSE-Extract-STFS.txt).

